# Direct dependencies of find_artek (production image). Edit this file, then regenerate the
# hash-locked requirements.txt with scripts/compile_lock.py; never edit requirements.txt by hand.
#
# Bounds: lower = the version production ran when the lock was introduced (pip freeze of
# 2026-11-16, Python 3.12.11), upper = the next major version. Django stays in its LTS series.
# The list is the one production was installed from; release 2026.1 keeps every entry, also
# those the code does not import (marked "not imported"), so the installed set is unchanged.
# Release 2026.6 (Phase 3, T2) removed the entries the code did not import (django-taggit,
# psycopg, PyPDF2, python-dotenv, ping3).

# Django 5.2 LTS, supported until April 2028 (Phase 3, T4; 6.2 LTS is FA-R5).
